# Patterns without a `**/` prefix only match at the build-context root —
# nested copies (e.g. apps/api/node_modules) are NOT excluded by a bare
# "node_modules" entry. We learned this the hard way: a host node_modules
# leaking into the API build broke drizzle-orm subpath resolution because
# the macOS pnpm symlinks pointed at /Volumes/... which doesn't exist
# inside the container. Always glob nested paths.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.prod.example
**/*.log

docs
.claude
.wolf
